 "remarks": "Discover the best of downtown Greenwich living in this exceptional luxury condominium, ideally situated at the end of a peaceful cul-de-sac just a sidewalk away from the shops, restaurants, and everyday conveniences of Greenwich Avenue. Offering over 2,500 square feet of beautifully designed living space, each residence features 3 bedrooms, 3.5 bathrooms, and a private elevator providing seamless access from the parking garage to the top floor. Thoughtfully designed with sophisticated finishes throughout, the homes showcase a stunning chef-inspired kitchen, elegant living spaces, and beautifully appointed bedrooms and baths. Combining the privacy and tranquility of a tucked-away setting with the convenience of an in-town lifestyle, these residences offer a truly special opportunity to enjoy luxury living in the heart of Greenwich.",
